                <syl /><neume facs="#m-027d8a32-04ea-4fc0-b3c7-7d754bbfbd42" type="punctum" xml:id="m-ac7af68b-b076-4cf5-88a6-0c2e1ac1e4ab">
                  <nc xml:id="m-1dce60fb-e1b0-48ec-a498-004d9cc3edd0" pname="a" oct="3"><episema xml:id="m-baf8e9ca-135d-466f-a2d3-68a31de0ae66" form="v" /></nc></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-b918bd56-29cc-4aa0-abfa-19f9b59f0edb">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-4530c83d-2a6c-415d-b0e2-ab887adfc690" type="punctum" xml:id="m-1cf89f82-638a-467d-b0bd-f7f0e10f2808">
                  <nc xml:id="m-fcc69ff6-4b71-457c-9b4c-000be1e4dd70" pname="f" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><custos xml:id="m-cfbd8c81-63c0-4eda-b38c-b501bff43d6f" facs="#m-735a8e6a-1504-400a-8788-2fdd8c69c5f0" pname="g" oct="3" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-6050b7fb-37cb-4002-b1af-2ce37bc75713"><lg xml:id="m-b23bd378-c50e-4d4e-9766-71e9c671cdd5"><l xml:id="m-4e1e9fa2-29b6-478a-b871-625bbf70c03e" facs="#m-e0ae65f9-960d-4f75-b566-4d11aef16aae" label="ambiguous">October 14.15.</l><l xml:id="m-ccf3c3b4-d7bc-474c-bd8c-9fc3673d6598" facs="#m-21f318e3-b027-4d0e-87f1-312bf51ea144" label="ambiguous">1688</l><l xml:id="m-5f352054-af77-4cfa-82a8-fc5bc476127f" facs="#m-9ad30fcb-add8-4475-8e2e-63d2e2af26f1" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-11362c9b-24e0-4cfa-ba37-e5b48d4bebf6" facs="#m-b940bd26-291f-490a-ac83-a3a794a3b034" label="lyrics-like">Audis tibi, Dómine hóstias im- et praeséntibus éxui malis confidi¬</l><l xml:id="m-20b83c21-d069-43cb-b260-fafd2240fb39" facs="#m-9ee49748-de2e-4c3a-815e-e3a80361965c" label="lyrics-like">Ll molámus in tuórum comme- mus, et futúris. Per Dóminum no¬</l><l xml:id="m-4ad23699-c904-4de4-a582-16e439f08932" facs="#m-db868608-30dd-4b9a-94b3-cd7d3c1fc5e7" label="lyrics-like">moratióne sanctórum: quibus nos! strum.</l><l xml:id="m-bc867276-38f3-4bf0-b5a8-566bfd8d6660" facs="#m-03cedc89-705e-4874-bd40-8f37c1453ce0" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-f12d713f-dcad-4b98-b261-7a21f866ac6f" facs="#m-32e6e5e8-d18e-4067-be48-8732ce7e5f4c" label="lyrics-like">DEfécti cibo potúque caelésti, [ratióne percépimus, ejus muniámur</l><l xml:id="m-aea55f40-9e60-4aa9-bce9-c820805c308c" facs="#m-180bbe9b-f743-423e-8afd-cd6883d7335c" label="lyrics-like">1t Deus noster, te súpplices exo-let précibus. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-3802ec81-f4b5-4782-a5b7-23a781dd1719" facs="#m-e239ce0c-6623-4994-810d-5fa6bc7e54d0" label="lyrics-like">rámus: ut in cujus haec commemo¬!</l><l xml:id="m-e5e44752-e7a9-43a8-a4d6-ab4cbcec0a66" facs="#m-28280021-dcda-4611-a4d0-1bf181b88074" label="text-like">St. Callistus I, Pope and Martyr.</l><l xml:id="m-ee8841da-2b5e-4367-9797-7c5d158d5a0a" facs="#m-d56b1161-d149-484f-a6a3-796168e12eae" label="ambiguous">14.</l><l xml:id="m-59c1c64b-3217-4202-bbc8-399d9f81fcf9" facs="#m-f5d18e59-a085-49cf-9ab7-6a7156dcf079" label="ambiguous">Double.</l><l xml:id="m-524f211b-4747-45de-bb9b-e2eef492cecf" facs="#m-10b5d196-f455-4ba9-a29f-39c19bb2951d" label="text-like">Mass. Si diligis me. from the Common of Holy Popes, 1122r, except the</l><l xml:id="m-9b6fc238-fce6-41ef-b747-6e1edd0e48b8" facs="#m-c816d816-8169-48ed-a0e6-47b12063c541" label="ambiguous">Prayers.</l><l xml:id="m-b17c1998-4fa9-4606-a65c-78f0f81927d9" facs="#m-328d9e42-1a6b-40b7-ad18-759cfa7d1e3b" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-07ed3be6-2cb2-4c15-9bab-f874271a8b34" facs="#m-a9920c52-e01a-44d5-a495-b69af2a6d8b1" label="lyrics-like">AEus, qui nos cónspicis ex nostra sanctórum tuórum exémpla re¬</l><l xml:id="m-29ec7006-d3ca-4894-bae1-0f94c049282d" facs="#m-7e0e9d5b-abe7-42f1-93a0-06d4ccbf148f" label="lyrics-like">U infirmitáte deficere:* ad amó-stáura. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-515fe9d8-a4e6-48c6-bc0d-15a7e4e79a79" facs="#m-a952eb20-2315-45e8-82e1-66985474537c" label="lyrics-like">rem tuum nos misericórditer per</l><l xml:id="m-32fe524f-1413-4015-8678-96b3d7be90d9" facs="#m-b80a03e4-2dac-42f0-8acb-a6eec02ee97e" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-809fcad0-7129-49af-8ff9-60f8f9a32b31" facs="#m-5c46b1d0-3eae-4056-a472-65a28a6c59cb" label="lyrics-like">Ystica nobis Dómine prosit! nostris expédiat, et perpétua salva¬</l><l xml:id="m-0456c993-1f11-4661-83af-e952cdc99c1a" facs="#m-4c796e90-b219-4773-a3ce-03c28e529582" label="lyrics-like">1C oblátio: quae nos et a reátibus tióne confirmet. Per Döminum.</l><l xml:id="m-78fd1e28-802f-42c7-a9db-3815b8074d19" facs="#m-a28565cc-9bd0-4cf4-9529-c0f3e7a51f37" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-de4d7ba7-a15c-44ad-9148-60cc3b7bff22" facs="#m-0e48e97e-3389-45fa-9d61-a55d0f7f4768" label="lyrics-like">Uaésumus omnípotens Deus: ut! puríficent, et recte vivéndi nobis</l><l xml:id="m-7f27ac97-dfcc-4836-a8f2-da21b0210611" facs="#m-87533d07-c93c-4b70-ab74-f136da7705c1" label="lyrics-like">U reátus nostros múnera sacrátal operéntur efféctum. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-76697442-8c9c-40c8-bcb6-2f6ea1d1f0b3" facs="#m-a74d51b9-276f-4959-a7fb-e14f135508a6" label="ambiguous">St. Teresa, Virgin.</l><l xml:id="m-226d64de-b9e1-42ba-84cf-20599e7d92c5" facs="#m-5db9ae03-39c6-4c89-92a8-63ef3fb5072f" label="ambiguous">15.</l><l xml:id="m-c045808b-7b86-4b63-bb32-3e373c7116a6" facs="#m-b99e31a5-ba33-44e0-90af-5b554f55bd08" label="ambiguous">Double.</l><l xml:id="m-2695e5d5-c046-4992-9e3b-f7836e26ec3c" facs="#m-71311766-39ac-4158-a5b3-892445a78735" label="text-like">At First and Second Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-6513a735-620b-4037-9ca9-89ccfeb61aa7" facs="#m-6d9e4fe6-68ee-42d6-adbc-92d1c781edc7" label="ambiguous">Hymn.</l><l xml:id="m-d5980e67-cd98-4b54-991b-2a23e6554591" facs="#m-7fb42787-f5f5-463a-a8fa-24e15ff7ed02" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-ce5bf980-927a-4e06-927d-0f3937eb9c04" facs="#m-5b4c9d51-078a-43e5-ac7d-6159a2261bd5" label="lyrics-like">Egis supérni núnti- a, Dómum patérnam dé-se¬</l><l xml:id="m-c3de4bae-feac-484f-a6aa-5cf8c822b983" facs="#m-4ddd713c-84af-46ad-aaa6-a5693d46fc8c" label="lyrics-like">ris, Térris Teré-sa bárba-ris Chrístum datú-ra aut sángui¬</l><l xml:id="m-ec1273e6-5a9f-44e2-b5d1-bd5e4cc9f000" facs="#m-3cb7d95a-8fdf-4456-8392-1256703979b8" label="lyrics-like">nem. 2. Sed te mánet su-ávi-or Mors, poéna póscit dúl¬</l><l xml:id="m-d8bbf5b0-1f12-433e-8bdb-f5e790740b65" facs="#m-516cb52e-c55c-4a6e-9778-b444c496b759" label="lyrics-like">In vúlnus icta cónci¬</l><l xml:id="m-b168b8d3-a5f4-438f-814f-0102c47de827" facs="#m-7b9b5334-ca13-4aa5-a65e-8758b004062e" label="lyrics-like">ci-or: Di-víni amó-ris cúspide</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>